r=\"rtl\">נָתַן אוֹת לְ</span>), cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲשֵׂה־עִמִּי אוֹת לְטוֹבָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 86:17\" href=\"/Psalms.86.17\">ψ 86:17</a>. (4) do someth. (in relation or intercourse) with (<span dir=\"rtl\">עִם</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵת</span> pers.), <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> subj. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:10\" href=\"/Exodus.34.10\">Ex 34:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:30\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.30\">Dt 1:30</a> <em>all that he did with you</em>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 10:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.10.21\">10:21</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 86:17\" href=\"/Psalms.86.17\">ψ 86:17</a> supr.), human subj. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 24:24\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.24.24\">2 Ch 24:24</a> (obj. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁפָטִים</span>), <a data-ref=\"Ruth 2:11\" href=\"/Ruth.2.11\">Ru 2:11</a>. (5) seldom c. ב, usually of executing judgment upon <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 28:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.28.18\">1 S 28:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 48:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.48.14\">Is 48:14</a>, more gen. <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:15\" href=\"/Esther.1.15\">Est 1:15</a> <em>what shall we do with the queen?</em> also, subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 25:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.25.11\">Ez 25:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 28:26\" href=\"/Ezekiel.28.26\">28:26</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 149:7\" href=\"/Psalms.149.7\">ψ 149:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 149:9\" href=\"/Psalms.149.9\">9</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:4\" href=\"/Numbers.33.4\">Nu 33:4</a> (on false gods); in good sense, <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ חֲסָדִים בּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:14\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.14\">Ne 13:14</a>. (6) of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>doing</em> the justice <span dir=\"rtl\">(מִשְׁפַּט)</span> of any one, i.e. maintaining his cause <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:45\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.45\">1 K 8:45</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:49\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.49\">49</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:5\" href=\"/Psalms.9.5\">ψ 9:5</a>. (7) c. adv. <em>do thus</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">כֹ